{"3779710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "CINESCAPE VR", "steam_appid": 3779710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>CINESCAPE-VR </i></strong><i>is a puzzle game that invites you to explore a variety of themed film studios. Thanks to your unique power, <strong>Cinemorphosis</strong>, you can turn real objects into fake props and vice versa. This power evolves and grows stronger as your adventure progresses. A series of intricate <strong>puzzles</strong> awaits you, increasing in complexity the further you advance.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features : </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your companion throughout the adventure is <strong>P4-TRIC</strong>, a robotic assistant built by the former director of the studios. He’s here to guide you through the tests… but behind his advice and encouragement may lie a hidden plan..</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your journey unfolds, a deeper truth emerges. You may not be who you thought you were, and the studio’s founder may have had far more personal reasons for designing these trials.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the adventure. Wield your new power – <strong>CINEMORPHOSIS </strong>– and uncover the mysteries of the studios..</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each environment is filled with subtle cinematic references, carefully placed for film buffs to discover.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your mission? </strong>Restore<strong> the Codex</strong> and uncover the secrets it holds by following in the footsteps of its mysterious creator.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>CINESCAPE-VR </i></strong><i>is a puzzle game that invites you to explore a variety of themed film studios. Thanks to your unique power, <strong>Cinemorphosis</strong>, you can turn real objects into fake props and vice versa. This power evolves and grows stronger as your adventure progresses. A series of intricate <strong>puzzles</strong> awaits you, increasing in complexity the further you advance.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features : </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your companion throughout the adventure is <strong>P4-TRIC</strong>, a robotic assistant built by the former director of the studios. He’s here to guide you through the tests… but behind his advice and encouragement may lie a hidden plan..</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your journey unfolds, a deeper truth emerges. You may not be who you thought you were, and the studio’s founder may have had far more personal reasons for designing these trials.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the adventure. Wield your new power – <strong>CINEMORPHOSIS </strong>– and uncover the mysteries of the studios..</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each environment is filled with subtle cinematic references, carefully placed for film buffs to discover.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your mission? </strong>Restore<strong> the Codex</strong> and uncover the secrets it holds by following in the footsteps of its mysterious creator.</p>", "short_description": "CINESCAPE-VR is a virtual reality escape game where you must solve puzzles within film studio sets, using the power of Cinemorphosis – a unique ability that lets you transform the objects around you – to uncover the secrets of the Cinetech company.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish -